<p>A wave of energy passes through your fungus, making it release immediate healing energies on you, healing you for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">200%, 300%, 377%, 442%, 500%</acronym> of your current life regeneration rate (<span style="color: #008645"><span class="tstr-color-GREEN"><acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 0, 0, 1, 1</acronym></span></span>).</p>